#: panels/applications/cc-applications-panel.c:1553
msgid "The sandbox could not be changed."
msgstr "Sandbox nije moguće promijeniti."

#: panels/applications/cc-applications-panel.c:1568
msgid "“%s” is unsandboxed. Restart it to apply."
msgstr "„%s” radi izvan sandboxa. Ponovno je pokrenite da se primijeni."

#: panels/applications/cc-applications-panel.c:1571
msgid "The sandbox of “%s” was restored."
msgstr "Sandbox za „%s” je vraćen."

